Z||000000||Xtreme Fiero's||10-16-2000||06:07 PM||||<BR>I will soon be geting a 85 GT that is in need of a trans. This car came with the stock 4-speed. what clutch will I need to use the 4:10 4-speed in the 85 GT? did and 85 GT's come w/ the 4:10? Thanks||||reg||1
Z||000001||mrfiero||10-16-2000||06:32 PM||||The 4.10 4-sp was only available on '84 Fieros.  If you want to put this tranny in a V-6 you will need to get a clutch for an '84 Fiero with this tranny.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Xtreme Fiero's||10-16-2000||07:04 PM|||| But there was no 84 V6 will a 4 cyl clutch work with the V6? will a cltch for a V6 4-speed (3.xx:1) clutch work or is it a diffrent trans altogether?||||reg||1
Z||000003||Cooter||10-16-2000||09:12 PM||||The aftermarket replacement part numbers for an 84 four speed/4cyl and an 85 four speed/6cyl are the same. I have a cheap parts store clutch for an 84 on my 3.4 with the four speed. It has only slipped one time, and it was before the clutch had enough break in time- since then all has been great.||||reg||1
